tart":"2026-11-13T02:00Z","home":"PHX","away":"CHA"},{"start":"2026-11-14T00:00Z","home":"IND","away":"NYK"},{"start":"2026-11-14T00:00Z","home":"ORL","away":"MIL"},{"start":"2026-11-14T01:00Z","home":"MIA","away":"CLE"},{"start":"2026-11-14T01:00Z","home":"CHI","away":"ATL"},{"start":"2026-11-14T01:00Z","home":"NOP","away":"MEM"},{"start":"2026-11-14T01:30Z","home":"HOU","away":"UTA"},{"start":"2026-11-14T02:30Z","home":"SAS","away":"GSW"},{"start":"2026-11-14T03:00Z","home":"SAC","away":"POR"},{"start":"2026-11-14T03:30Z","home":"LAC","away":"OKC"}],"news":[{"id":"n1","cat":"Major","title":"Democrat Scott Colom wins Mississippi Senate seat in upset","summary":"Colom beat incumbent Republican Cindy Hyde-Smith 49.2% to 48.7%, a margin of about 4,585 votes, eight days after election night. Democrats will hold 55 Senate seats with Alaska still uncalled.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/democrat-scott-colom-wins-mississippi-senate-seat-in-historic-upset","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n2","cat":"World","title":"Ukraine-Russia talks end with prisoner swap deal, no ceasefire","summary":"Two days of U.S.-mediated talks in Abu Dhabi produced an in-principle exchange of 1,000 to 1,500 prisoners per side, but no breakthrough on territory. U.S. envoys Witkoff and Kushner head to Moscow, then Dublin to meet Zelenskyy.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/11/abu-dhabi-peace-talks-end-with-prisoner-exchange-agreement-as-us-envoys-prepare-to-meet-pu","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n3","cat":"Business","title":"Nvidia shares drop as board reportedly weighs ousting Jensen Huang","summary":"Nvidia fell about 8% after hours Wednesday and roughly 11% over five days after the WSJ reported the board may remove Huang, following reports of two affairs. The company has no clear successor.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/nvidias-stock-drops-as-board-reportedly-preps-to-oust-ceo-jensen-huang/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Business","title":"Stocks rally on AI optimism: S&P 500 +1.31%, Nasdaq 100 +2.28%","summary":"CoreWeave's strong results revived the AI trade Wednesday, with the Dow up 0.49%. CoreWeave jumped over 24%, Nebius over 15% and Micron over 11%.","source":"Barchart via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/stock-indexes-finish-sharply-higher-213410428.html","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Major","title":"Brooklyn building collapse kills at least two, injures 17","summary":"A three-storey building fell next to an excavation site in Brooklyn on Wednesday; four people were critical and seven children were among those pulled from the rubble. The cause is under investigation.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/at-least-two-dead-while-others-are-trapped-in-the-rubble-after-a-building-collapse-in-new-","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Canada","title":"Ford, Ottawa and Unifor meet Stellantis over Brampton plant sale","summary":"Leaders meet Stellantis in Toronto Thursday after it sold its idled Brampton plant to defence maker Roshel, which Unifor says threatens 2,000+ laid-off workers' jobs. A $1.5B support deal requires Stellantis to keep its Ontario footprint to 2035.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12147000/ford-feds-unifor-set-for-high-stakes-meeting-with-stellantis/","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n7","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI's quarterly revenue reportedly tops $10B for first time","summary":"Q3 revenue was about $10 billion, up nearly 50% from $6.7 billion in Q2, per Bloomberg; adjusted operating margin improved to -109% from -150%. Its annual run rate is about $50 billion.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/openais-quarterly-revenue-reportedly-crosses-10b-for-the-first-time/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n8","cat":"World","title":"Spain holds first general strike in 14 years over wages and housing","summary":"Unions staged a 24-hour nationwide strike under the slogan 'Wages, housing and prices'; more than 70 people were arrested and industrial power demand fell 25.6%. Rents have risen about 80% in a decade.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/spain-holds-its-first-general-strike-in-14-years-amid-mass-protests-and-police-charges","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney leaves for Ireland, Asia summits including Xi meeting","summary":"The PM travels to Dublin, Cambodia, the Philippines and China through Nov. 19, attending ASEAN, Francophonie and APEC summits. Canada expects to finalize trade deals with ASEAN and the Philippines in Manila.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12146059/carney-summits-asia-ireland/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n10","cat":"World","title":"NATO jets fail to down drone that crossed Baltic states","summary":"A drone entered Lithuania from Belarus overnight, survived two NATO intercept attempts, then crossed Latvia and Estonia into Russia. Its origin remains unconfirmed; balloon sightings also disrupted airports.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/11/a-restless-and-difficult-night-in-the-baltics-as-nato-fighter-jets-fail-to-shoot-down-dron","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"Congo's Ebola outbreak, its deadliest ever, passes 11,000 cases","summary":"Government data show 11,042 cases and 5,387 deaths, concentrated in Ituri and North Kivu where fighting hampers responders. The Bundibugyo strain has no approved vaccine.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/11/deadliest-ebola-outbreak-in-congos-history-reaches-11000-cases","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n12","cat":"AI","title":"EU pushes back on U.S. plan to expand Pax Silica AI alliance","summary":"Washington wants members to endorse an economic security declaration in San Francisco this weekend. EU states object to broad tech definitions and the term 'superintelligence', and authorized the Commission to negotiate.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/trumps-upgrade-of-us-led-ai-alliance-runs-into-european-resistance","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Business","title":"UK economy grows 0.7% in Q3 as AI demand lifts output","summary":"GDP rose 0.7% in July-September, up from 0.5% in Q2, and 1.9% year on year. Computer programming and consultancy output jumped 4.4%.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/uk-economy-grows-07-in-third-quarter-as-ai-demand-lifts-output","published":"2026-11-12"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa says Russian players will be barred from World Juniors","summary":"Russian and Belarusian players won't be allowed to compete at the Dec. 26 tournament in Edmonton and Red Deer even with valid visas, after a CAS ruling ordered the IIHF to reinstate Russia.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12147202/world-juniors-russia-visa-players/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n15","cat":"AI","title":"UK chip startup Fractile raises $720M to challenge AI chip leaders","summary":"The Series C, led by Thrive, Founders Fund, Lightspeed and Redpoint, reportedly values Fractile near $7 billion. It plans to ship its first chips and systems in 2027.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/with-720m-round-britains-fractile-gets-a-leg-up-in-the-race-for-ai-chips/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Canada","title":"Molson Coors recalls 29 beers across Canada over possible metal","summary":"Products including Molson Canadian, Coors Light and Blue Moon packaged at four breweries may contain metal pieces. The CFIA lists it as a low-risk Class III recall; no harm has been reported.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12146279/beer-recall-canada-molson-coors-bluemoon/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Meta's longtime infrastructure chief Santosh Janardhan to step down","summary":"Janardhan, at Meta since 2009 and leader of its Meta Compute data centre push, will leave in 2027. Former Amazon executive Dave Brown takes over.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/meta-is-losing-its-longtime-head-of-infrastructure/","published":"2026-11-11"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Major","title":"ESA's Hera probe begins close inspection of DART-struck asteroid","summary":"Hera is surveying Dimorphos and Didymos from 25-30 km and will move to about 20 km next month, studying the aftermath of NASA's 2022 DART impact.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/europes-hera-spacecraft-begins-close-inspections-of-asteroid-in-planetary-defence-mission","published":"2026-11-12"}]}